        <h1 class="copy-title">The Ultimate Ballet Quiz: Are You an Amateur or a Prima Ballerina?</h1>
        <p>
		Do you know your plié from your pas de valse? How about your écarté from your échappé? Whether you’ve grown up as a lover of ballet, you’re learning to dance now, or you danced back in childhood but haven’t picked up a pair of <a target="_blank" href="https://us.blochworld.com/collections/adults-dance-shoes-ballet">pointe</a> shoes in a while, we’re interested to see just how much you know about the beautiful art of ballet.
		</p>
        <p>That’s why we’ve put together the ultimate ballet quiz – to keep you on your toes and see what level your ballet knowledge is! Are you a beginner or professional? Take our quiz and discover your dance IQ…

</p>
